309: 
310: Prefer the TEAM NAMES given below as a disambiguator when multiple
311: players share a name (e.g. several Mohammad Shami's).
312: 
313: Return ONLY the final corrected JSON object, keyed by the player's
314: full name EXACTLY as given.  Every player from the initial guesses
315: must appear as a key.  Use the same value vocabulary:
316:   batting_style ∈ {"RHB", "LHB", "unknown"}
317:   bowling_style: short English phrase, "None", or "unknown"
318: No markdown fences, no prose, no citations inline — just the JSON.
319: 
320: Teams (for disambiguation): {teams}
321: 
322: Initial guesses (JSON):
323: {guesses}
