   1: """Scoreboard — pre-built scorecards with null stats.
   2: 
   3: Squads are known before the first ball. Batting and bowling cards
   4: are pre-built with all 11 players. Stats start at null (hasn't
   5: batted/bowled yet). The match is about filling in the blanks.
   6: 
   7: Hard limits only: negative scores, overs > 20, wickets > 10.
