2330:         # === Issue 2: bowler rotation rule (2026-04-21) ===
2331:         # A bowler cannot bowl two consecutive overs in T20/ODI.  If
2332:         # `_prev_over_bowler` is set and the incoming read names that
2333:         # same bowler as current, the read has to be wrong by the laws
2334:         # of cricket — typically an end-of-spell / cumulative-stats
