 896:                     f"[ROLLBACK] Overs misread recovery: previously "
 897:                     f"archived over {archived_int} = {_archived_balls} "
 898:                     f"but team_overs now reads {overs} (still in "
 899:                     f"over {archived_int}). Rewinding archive — "
 900:                     f"restoring this_over and clearing slot.")
