 916:         # Multi-over jump guard. Cricket can never advance more than
 917:         # one over at a time within the pipeline's per-frame
 918:         # processing cadence. If new_int > _last_over_int + 1, this
 919:         # is one of:
 920:         #   - A Scout misread of the team-overs digit (e.g. 9.5 → 11.0
 921:         #     for one frame, then back to 10.0)
